## `/teach` (Matt Pocock)

User-invoked only. Dedicated folder (`~/Documents/Research/<topic>/` or separate repo). Stateful: `MISSION.md`, `lessons/`, `reference/`, `learning-records/`, `assets/`. Name workspace path explicitly (skill path bug #377).

## Adversarial review (hard forks only)

2-3 readonly consultations in parallel when costly to reverse and still uncertain. [.cursor/skills/advisor/SKILL.md](.cursor/skills/advisor/SKILL.md).

## Guardrails

- Same command fails twice: stop, report cause, give exact local command.
- Confirm before force-push, mass delete, schema drops, killing foreign tmux.
- [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) safety rules. Doc sync: [.cursor/rules/agents-doc-sync.mdc](.cursor/rules/agents-doc-sync.mdc).
